Hi Franziska,

Did you carefully follow the instructions? For Windows computers, please check here: https://github.com/stan-dev/rstan/wiki/Installing-RStan-on-Windows

Installing RStan is probably the biggest hurdle for using hBayesDM..

To check if RStan is correctly installed, you can also check this code, which we used for a recent workshop at APS 2017: https://github.com/CCS-Lab/APS2017-workshop/blob/master/R_Codes/tutorial/1_test_stan.R

Best,
Young

